<p id="b911" class="pw-post-body-paragraph lg lh fq li b lj lk ll lm ln lo lp lq lr ls lt lu lv lw lx ly lz ma mb mc md fj bk" data-selectable-paragraph="">Quill, as one of the most modern rich text editors, has reached over 35k stars on&nbsp;<a class="af me" href="https://github.com/quilljs/quill/stargazers" target="_blank" rel="noopener ugc nofollow">Github</a>. Its numerous useful features make it extensible, compatible, and simple to start to use as well. Another important characteristic of Quill resides in its customizability. The very feature enables developers to tailor Quill for their needs.</p>
